g within countries.","cites":["sources/europe-2031"]},{"year":2050,"text":"A generation raised with minds-on-tap; the meaning politics the far field keeps on the table.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace"]}],"science":[{"year":2060,"text":"The frontier is nonhuman: discovery outpaces comprehension, and translation becomes its own discipline.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"climate":[{"year":2030,"text":"Constraint as climate policy: scarce compute keeps AI load flat while efficiency work compounds.","cites":["concepts/compute-governance"]},{"year":2060,"text":"Climate outcomes track governance more than compute: the decisive variable was always deployment speed of what the science found.","cites":["industries/energy"]}]}}